 core_synastry: `Saturn square Neptune between these charts means one person's structural principle and the other person's transcendent principle are at ninety-degree tension. Consolidation and dissolution cut across each other.`,
 behavioral_synastry: `When one person's Saturn builds structure, the other person's Neptune wants to dissolve boundaries, and both are legitimate but geometrically incompatible. The square means you're both trying to navigate the material and spiritual but in ways that create friction. These relationships work when both people recognize different approaches to form and formlessness don't always cooperate and develop fluency in when to honor Saturn's structure and when to honor Neptune's surrender.`,
