 romantic_synastry: `One partner's Saturn stands square to the other's Neptune across ninety degrees of sustained tension. Saturn wants the relationship to have form, proven foundation, reliable structure, measurable commitment. Neptune wants the relationship to transcend, spiritual connection, dissolved boundaries, faith in the ineffable. Both are caring in geometrically incompatible directions. The work is building a relationship that can hold both Saturn's structure and Neptune's dissolution without forcing them to agree.`,
