 feed: `Saturn and Neptune are flowing together between these charts today in natural harmony. One person's structural requirement and the other person's transcendent vision are drawing from the same elemental source right now. Consolidation and dissolution support each other in this connection. When one person's Saturn builds foundation, the other person's Neptune knows what that structure allows as transcendence. When Neptune dissolves boundaries, Saturn gives that dissolution practical form. Use this for spiritual work that needs both discipline and surrender, structures that serve what lies beyond structure.`,
